{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/profile_TW.png?t=1744197278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Story.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a child playing Dipets, the most popular video game among children where you have to train your own monsters and face them in combat. When you get home you find a device that transports you to the digital world, but something is wrong. Pixel City, the city of the Dipets, is deserted and soon we will have to take on the task of finding them, restore their memory and rebuild the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Pulled_in.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover what happened to the inhabitants while exploring the misteries of that world and help them rebuild their city. All of this while taking care of your Dipet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Features.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Train your own Dipet</strong> while taking care of its needs. You will have to feed it, take it to the bathroom or order it when to sleep. Remember to take good care of it because if it gets mad, it won't follow your orders in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Needs.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight alonside your Dipet</strong> against a wide variety of enemies.\u00a0You will order your Dipet what should do in combat to defeat enemies: use skills, defend, control it to evade area attacks, flee\u00a0or use items to help it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Combat.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a strange world</strong> and discover its misteries.\u00a0You will travel through\u00a0diferent biomes, solve different puzzles and discover different friendly villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help the inhabitants</strong> to rebuild the city and its services. The key to success it to recruit different npcs that will unlock new buildings and mechanics like fast travel, shops, farms\u00a0and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/City.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect items, fish, cook</strong> or spent your time in multiple minigames. You will be able to train your Dipet with multiple minigames, fish to get food or collect different items to help you in your adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686400/extras/Fishing.gif?t=1744197278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Parg joined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2686400/ce171a6e90b32cb731e67bf633122a8c6f192596.jpg"},{"name":"Gornie joined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2686400/9c56eb302a524cfed575b22db2d2a6c5e51ff8a6.jpg"},{"name":"Lepurjo joined",